msgstr "K-POP"

msgid "Autoplay"
msgstr "Reproduction automatic"

msgid "Start playing automatically on launch"
msgstr "Comenciar le reproduction automaticamente al lanceamento"

msgid "Enable pause and resume"
msgstr "Activar pausa e reprise"

msgid "Use pause and resume for the main playback button"
msgstr "Usar pausa e reprise pro le button principal de reproduction"

msgid "Discord Rich Presence"
msgstr "Discord Rich Presence"

msgid "Enable Discord Rich Presence at runtime"
msgstr "Activar Discord Rich Presence durante le execution"

msgid "It is time to ditch other radios. Stream and metadata provided by LISTEN.moe."
msgstr "Il es tempore de cambiar de radio. Fluxo e metadatos fornite per LISTEN.moe."

msgid "J-POP and K-POP radio"
msgstr "Radio J-POP e K-POP"

msgid "Listen to J-POP and K-POP"
msgstr "Ascolta J-POP e K-POP"

msgid "Pause and resume the live stream"
msgstr "Pausa e reprende le emission in directo"

msgid "Animated sound bars that react to the music"
msgstr "Barras sonor animate que reage al musica"

msgid "Dynamic colors based on the current album or artist cover"
msgstr "Colores dynamic basate sur le copertura del album o le imagine del artista actual"

msgid "No ads"
msgstr "Sin publicitate"

msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "Prime version."

msgid "When connected and there is no album or artist image"
msgstr "Quando connectite e il non ha imagine del album o del artista"

msgid "Colored window when connected"
msgstr "Fenestra colorate quando connectite"

msgid "AI translation (GPT-5.2); reviewed by nobody"
msgstr "AI translation (Codex); not human-reviewed"

msgid "This release focuses on visuals and localization."
msgstr "Iste version se concentra sur le apparentia e le localisation."

msgid "Fine-tuned dark/light mode detection so light colors are no longer mistaken for dark ones."
msgstr "Detection del modo obscur/clar affinata pro non plus confunder colores clar con obscur."

msgid "Polished translations and improved how they are applied."
msgstr "Traductiones affinata e lor application meliorate."

msgid "Removed gaps between sound bars."
msgstr "Spatios inter le barras sonor removite."

msgid "Streaming logic now better handles connection issues and stream changes."
msgstr "Le emission ora tracta melio problemas de connexion e cambios de fluxo."

msgid "Clarified the application description."
msgstr "Description del application clarificate."

msgid "Translated image captions"
msgstr "Legendas del imagines traducite"

msgid "Updated screenshots to use a more reasonable window size"
msgstr "Capturas de schermo actualisate con un dimension de fenestra plus appropriate"

msgid "Updated application icon"
msgstr "Icone del application actualisate"

msgid "Display the application icon in media controls."
msgstr "Monstrar le icone del application in le controlos multimedial."

msgid "Optional Discord activity sharing"
msgstr "Compartimento optional de activitate sur Discord"

msgid "Added Discord activity sharing."
msgstr "Addite compartimento de activitate sur Discord."

msgid "Reconnect to Discord instead of disabling this feature."
msgstr "Reconnexion a Discord in vice de disactivar iste functionalitate."

msgid "Added flags to control pause behavior, autoplay, or disable Discord integration."
msgstr "Addite optiones pro controlar le pausa, le reproduction automatic o disactivar le integration con Discord."

msgid "Fixed an issue where paused playback resumed during a network disruption."
msgstr "Corrigite un problema que reprendeva le reproduction pausate durante un interruption de rete."

msgid "Added preferences and keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "Addite preferentias e claves de accesso rapide."

msgid "Changed pause, resume, and station switching behavior."
msgstr "Cambiate le comportamento de pausa, reprise e cambio de station."

msgid "Added startup options for pause/resume or stop behavior, with play/stop now the default."
msgstr "Addite optiones initial pro pausa/reprise o stop, con reproduction/stop como predefinition."

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Cercar actualisationes"

msgid "Cancel update"
msgstr "Cancellar actualisation"

msgid "Couldn't check for updates"
msgstr "Impossibile cercar actualisationes"

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Reproba plus tarde."

msgid "Already up to date"
msgstr "Jam actualisate"

msgid "You have the latest version of Listen Moe."
msgstr "Tu ha le ultime version de Listen Moe."

msgid "The release metadata is missing a valid SHA-256 digest."
msgstr "Le metadatos del version non contine un summa de controlo SHA-256 valide."

msgid "Couldn't download the update"
msgstr "Impossibile discargar le actualisation"

msgid "Update canceled"
msgstr "Actualisation cancellate"

msgid "The update was canceled."
msgstr "Le actualisation ha essite cancellate."

msgid "The update check was canceled."
msgstr "Le cerca de actualisationes ha essite cancellate."

msgid "The downloaded installer will not be installed."
msgstr "Le installator discargate non sera installate."

msgid "Installing update"
msgstr "Installation del actualisation"

msgid "Listen Moe will close."
msgstr "Listen Moe se claudera."

msgid "Couldn't install the update"
msgstr "Impossibile installar le actualisation"

msgid "Checking for updates"
msgstr "Cerca de actualisationes"

msgid "Downloading update"
msgstr "Discargamento del actualisation"

msgid "Update ready"
msgstr "Actualisation preste"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "Discargate"

msgid "Looking for a newer Windows installer on GitHub Releases."
msgstr "Cerca de un installator Windows plus recente sur GitHub Releases."

msgid "A newer Windows release is available."
msgstr "Un version Windows plus recente es disponibile."

msgid "The installer is ready to run."
msgstr "Le installator es preste pro execution."

msgid "Couldn't start the installer."
msgstr "Impossibile lancear le installator."

msgid "Removed pause/resume from stable builds."
msgstr "Pausa/reprise removite del versiones stabile."

msgid "Separate experimental features from stable features."
msgstr "Separation del functionalitates experimental e stabile."

msgid "Volume control added."
msgstr "Controlo de volumine addite."

msgid "Karaoke"
msgstr "Karaoke"

msgid "Show karaoke"
msgstr "Monstrar karaoke"

msgid "Finding lyrics…"
msgstr "Cerca del texto del canto…"

msgid "Just a moment"
msgstr "Un momento"

msgid "No synchronized lyrics"
msgstr "Nulle texto de canto synchronisate"

msgid "This song can still be your tiny concert."
msgstr "Iste canto pote ancora esser tu parve concerto."

msgid "Couldn't load lyrics"
msgstr "Impossibile cargar le texto del canto"

msgid "Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Reproba in un momento."

msgid "Lyrics by LRCLIB"
msgstr "Textos de cantos per LRCLIB"

msgid "Added lyrics."
msgstr "Addite textos de cantos."

msgid "Added a song progress bar."
msgstr "Addite un barra de progresso del canto."

msgid "Long artist and song names scroll smoothly."
msgstr "Nomines longe de artistas e cantos se displacia fluidemente."

msgid "Hover over the title to see the full text."
msgstr "Passa le cursor super le titulo pro vider le texto complete."

msgid "Scrolling text and background animations respect Reduce Motion."
msgstr "Le texto mobile e le animationes de fundo respecta le option Reducer le movimento."
